      "value": "progressive stiffness of axial muscles and proximal limb muscles; hyperlordosis of lumbar spine; episodic spasms precipitated by jarring or sudden movement; normal intellectual, sensory, and motor examination when not in spasm; marked amelioration of symptoms with IV diazepam; EMG showing increased volitional activity and poor relaxation; positive anti-GAD antibodies",
